   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Hi Herbert -<div><br></div><div>For the y axis label, I am supposing that you are using the black and white theme set, i.e., theme_bw() (it has that problem).  To fix it, as Hadley suggested a few days ago, this should work</div><div><br></div><div>theme_set(theme_bw())  ## this sets the theme as theme_bw()<br>theme_update(axis.title.y =<br>  theme_text(size = 12, angle = 90, vjust = 0.5)) ## this updates it so that the text is in the right place</div><div><br></div><div>For the rest, I am not sure that I understand what you want to do, but perhaps the gist is in some of the following examples :</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(156,34,17)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">srda</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\"> &lt;- </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">dat</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\"> &lt;- </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">read.table</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">textConnection</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span>&#39;   Thresh Time Color Intens Seen        rFit        gFit</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(156,34,17)\">1        1    0   RED    0.8    1  0.11033208  1.94633102</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(156,34,17)\">2        1    2   RED    0.2    1  0.01516950  1.69396036</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(156,34,17)\">3        1    3   RED   -0.4    1 -0.02895994  1.57692931</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(156,34,17)\">4        1    4   RED   -1.0    1 -0.07093717  1.46560594</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(156,34,17)\">8        1    8   RED   -1.0    1 -0.21934788  1.07202154</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(156,34,17)\">11       1   11   RED   -1.2    1 -0.31271811  0.82440417</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(156,34,17)\">15       1   16   RED   -1.2    1 -0.44033896  0.48595437&#39;<span style=\"color:#001b93\">))</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(0,27,147);min-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(156,34,17)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">molten_srda</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\"> &lt;- </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">melt</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">srda</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">, </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">id</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span>&#39;Thresh&#39;<span style=\"color:#001b93\">, </span>&#39;Time&#39;<span style=\"color:#001b93\">, </span>&#39;Color&#39;<span style=\"color:#001b93\">, </span>&#39;Intens&#39;<span style=\"color:#001b93\">, </span>&#39;Seen&#39;<span style=\"color:#001b93\">))</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(0,27,147);min-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">y_title<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> &lt;- </span>expression<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9c2211\">&#39;Intensity,  &#39;</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\"> * </span>cd<span style=\"color:#001b93\">/</span>m<span style=\"color:#001b93\">^</span><span style=\"color:#224f1e\">2</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">p<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> &lt;- </span>ggplot<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span>srda<span style=\"color:#001b93\">) +</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#001b93\">  </span>scale_x_continuous<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span>name<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#9c2211\">&quot;Time (ms)&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">, </span>limits<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> = </span>c<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span><span style=\"color:#224f1e\">0</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">, </span><span style=\"color:#224f1e\">20</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">)) +</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#001b93\">  </span>scale_y_continuous<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span>name<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> = </span>y_title<span style=\"color:#001b93\">, </span>limits<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> = </span>c<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(-</span><span style=\"color:#224f1e\">10</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">,</span><span style=\"color:#224f1e\">3</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">)) +</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#001b93\">  </span>geom_point<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span>aes<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span>Time<span style=\"color:#001b93\">, </span>Intens<span style=\"color:#001b93\">), </span>colour<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#9c2211\">&#39;red&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">) +</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#001b93\">  </span>geom_line<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span>aes<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span>x<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> = </span>Time<span style=\"color:#001b93\">, </span>y<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> = </span>value<span style=\"color:#001b93\">, </span>colour<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> = </span>variable<span style=\"color:#001b93\">), </span>data<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> = </span>molten_srda<span style=\"color:#001b93\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(0,27,147)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">p</span>  </div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(0,27,147);min-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">tt<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> &lt;- </span>data.frame<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(0,27,147)\">  <span style=\"color:#000000\">x</span> &lt;- <span style=\"color:#000000\">seq</span>(<span style=\"color:#224f1e\">0</span>, <span style=\"color:#224f1e\">16</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">by</span> = <span style=\"color:#224f1e\">4</span>),</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(0,27,147)\">  <span style=\"color:#000000\">y</span> &lt;- <span style=\"color:#000000\">seq</span>(-<span style=\"color:#224f1e\">8</span>, <span style=\"color:#224f1e\">2</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">length</span> = <span style=\"color:#224f1e\">5</span>),</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(0,27,147)\">  <span style=\"color:#000000\">text</span> &lt;- <span style=\"color:#000000\">c</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">letters</span>[<span style=\"color:#224f1e\">1</span>:<span style=\"color:#224f1e\">5</span>]),</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(0,27,147)\">  <span style=\"color:#000000\">text_size</span> &lt;- <span style=\"color:#224f1e\">5</span>*(<span style=\"color:#224f1e\">1</span>:<span style=\"color:#224f1e\">5</span>)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(0,27,147)\">)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(0,27,147);min-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">p1<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> &lt;- </span>p<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> + </span>geom_text<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span>data<span style=\"color:#001b93\">=</span>tt<span style=\"color:#001b93\">,</span>aes<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span>x<span style=\"color:#001b93\">=</span>x<span style=\"color:#001b93\">,</span>y<span style=\"color:#001b93\">=</span>y<span style=\"color:#001b93\">,</span>label<span style=\"color:#001b93\">=</span>text<span style=\"color:#001b93\">, </span>size<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> = </span>text_size<span style=\"color:#001b93\">))</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">p1</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(0,27,147);min-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">p2<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> &lt;- </span>p<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> + </span>geom_text<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span>data<span style=\"color:#001b93\">=</span>tt<span style=\"color:#001b93\">,</span>aes<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span>x<span style=\"color:#001b93\">=</span>x<span style=\"color:#001b93\">,</span>y<span style=\"color:#001b93\">=</span>y<span style=\"color:#001b93\">,</span>label<span style=\"color:#001b93\">=</span>text<span style=\"color:#001b93\">), </span>size<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#224f1e\">10</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">p2</div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>To change the labels and title in the legend, you can use something like :</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#001b93\">  </span>scale_colour_discrete<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9c2211\">&#39;Fit&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">, </span>labels<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> = </span>c<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9c2211\">&#39;Red&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9c2211\">&#39;Green&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">))</span></div></div><div><br></div><div>Hope it helps!</div><div>david.</div></div>"
    ],
